---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GoGame from '../components/GoGame.astro';
import { experience, honorSpotlight, honorList } from '../data/experience';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';

const album = [
  { src: '/images/go-congress-2017.jpg', caption: 'US Go Congress · San Diego, 2017', alt: 'Young Alan mid-game at the 2017 US Go Congress', rot: -2.2 },
  { src: '/images/go-pro-2017.jpg', caption: 'learning from a 9p · Go Congress 2017', alt: 'A 9-dan professional reviewing stones at Alan’s board during the 2017 US Go Congress', rot: 1.6 },
  { src: '/images/go-tournament-2018.jpg', caption: 'tournament in Osaka· 2018', alt: 'A crowded youth Go tournament hall in summer 2018', rot: -1.8 },
  { src: '/images/alan-fanuc.jpg', caption: 'with the FANUC · CMU Intelligent Control Lab', alt: 'Alan adjusting the end effector of a FANUC LR Mate robot arm', rot: 2.0 },
  { src: '/images/mill19-yaskawa.jpg', caption: 'Mill 19 · ARM Institute', alt: 'Alan in a hard hat next to a large blue Yaskawa industrial robot at Mill 19', rot: -1.5 },
  { src: '/images/yc-dinner-2025.jpg', caption: 'with Jared Friedman · YC dinner, 2025', alt: 'Alan standing with Jared Friedman at a Y Combinator dinner in 2025', rot: 1.9 },
  { src: '/images/jshs-podium.jpg', caption: 'presenting · National JSHS 2024', alt: 'Alan presenting at the podium of the 2024 National Junior Science and Humanities Symposium', rot: 1.7 },
  { src: '/images/txsef-stage.jpg', caption: 'Best of State · TXSEF 2025', alt: 'Alan receiving the Senior Best of State award in Physical Sciences at TXSEF', rot: -2.1 },
];

const featured = [
  {
    source: 'CBS Austin',
    title: 'Central Texas students excel at world’s largest science fair',
    note: 'ISEF 2025 coverage, Grand Award included',
    url: 'https://cbsaustin.com/news/local/central-texas-students-excel-at-worlds-largest-science-fair-earn-top-awards-scholarships',
  },
  {
    source: 'ARM Institute',
    title: 'First Lady Jill Biden visits Mill 19',
    note: 'the robotic Lego assembly testbed grew out of my lab’s work at CMU',
    url: 'https://arminstitute.org/news/2023-flotus/',
  },
  {
    source: 'Marginal Revolution',
    title: 'Emergent Ventures, 36th cohort',
    note: 'Tyler Cowen’s grant announcement',
    url: 'https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/08/emergent-ventures-36th-cohort.html',
  },
  {
    source: 'Society for Science',
    title: 'Regeneron STS 2025 Scholars',
    note: 'Top-300 scholar for AssemblyComplete',
    url: 'https://www.societyforscience.org/regeneron-sts/2025-scholars/',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Alan Chen: from Mudkip games on Scratch and competitive Go to robotics research at CMU and robot learning at UT Austin."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal in-view">about</p>
      <h1 class="page-title reveal in-view">From Scratch blocks to robot arms</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <div class="container story-grid">
      <div class="story-prose reveal in-view">
        <p>
          I'm Alan, a current sophmore studying CS under UT Austin's <strong>Turing Scholars</strong> honors program and a
          researcher at the <a class="squiggle" href="https://larg.cs.utexas.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learning
          Agents Research Group</a>, where I work on reinforcement learning for
          vision-language-action models: teaching mobile robots to act on what they see and read.
          I'm increasingly drawn to continual learning and recursive self-improvement: how agents
          can learn from experience and improve their own learning processes.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started programming at nine, making Mudkip-themed games on
          <a href={profile.links.scratch} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scratch</a> as
          <em>@ac91305</em> (the avatar in the footer is the original).
        </p>
        <p>
          Before research, there was <strong>Go</strong>. I competed as one of the top five youth
          players in the US, placed 3rd at AGA YoungLions and the US Go Congress in 2019–20, and
          represented the USA at tournaments in Shanghai and Osaka, training in the 5–6 dan classes
          while I was in China. What kept me at the board was never just the strategy. You can read
          a person through how they play, aggressive or patient or instinctual, before you share a
          single word of the same language. I was a kid memorizing joseki when AlphaGo and Lee
          Sedol traded Move 37 and Move 78; the animation on the homepage replays Lee's. Recently been thinking about starting a Go club at UT.
          Also, I managed to find a old game of mine displayed below (I swear I play better at in-person tournaments).
        </p>

        <GoGame
          src="/go/agcAlanCh-KXie2015.sgf"
          caption="me (white) throwing against a 3d in 2020 · B+1.5"
        />

        <p>
          Research pulled me in the summer after ninth grade, at a UT San Antonio REU working on
          autonomous-vehicle simulation. That became my first paper. The next fall I joined the
          <a class="squiggle" href="http://icontrol.ri.cmu.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Intelligent
          Control Lab</a> at CMU's Robotics Institute, and for two years I
          spent evenings on robotic assembly: three papers, one of them first-authored, and a lot of
          hours getting algorithms that worked in simulation to also work on a real FANUC arm. That
          work carried me to an <strong>ISEF Grand Award</strong> and <strong>Regeneron STS
          Scholar</strong> recognition, and the lab's Lego assembly testbed was part of what First
          Lady Jill Biden came to see at Mill 19.
        </p>
        <p>
          Now in Austin: fine-tuning robot foundation models at LARG, and fresh off a
          summer at <strong>Arm</strong> as an LLM research engineering intern on the Central
          Engineering AI team, where I independently developed a
          <a class="squiggle" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.24601" target="_blank" rel="noopener">recursive
          language model</a> approach and analyzed complex workloads to optimize uArch. The thing I
          cared about at nine is still the thing I care about: building stuff that has to work
          outside a vacuum, where reality evaluates your idea rollouts quickly.
        </p>
        <p>
          When async off the clock: intramural basketball, lifting, teaching Sunday Chinese school (130+
          students over four years), and a top-200-in-the-US Brawl Stars rank I'm still proud of.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="album" aria-label="Photo album">
        {album.map((p, i) => (
          <figure class="polaroid reveal" style={`--rot:${p.rot}deg; --reveal-delay:${i * 0.07}s`}>
            <img src={p.src} alt={p.alt} loading={i < 2 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} />
            <figcaption>{p.caption}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))}
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">featured</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">In the wild</h2>
      <div class="featured-list">
        {featured.map((f, i) => (
          <a class="featured-row reveal" href={f.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 0.05}s`}>
            <span class="featured-source">{f.source}</span>
            <span class="featured-body">
              <span class="featured-title">{f.title} <span class="ext" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
              <span class="featured-note">{f.note}</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">the path so far</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Experience</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        {experience.map((e, i) => (
          <div class="tl-row reveal" style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 0.05}s`}>
            <div class="tl-period">
              <span>{e.period}</span>
              {e.status === 'now' && <span class="tl-badge now">now</span>}
              {e.status === 'upcoming' && <span class="tl-badge up">next</span>}
            </div>
            <div class="tl-body">
              <h3 class="tl-role">{e.role}</h3>
              <p class="tl-org">
                {e.logo && <img class="tl-logo" src={e.logo} alt="" loading="lazy" />}
                {e.link ? (
                  <a href={e.link} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{e.org} ↗</a>
                ) : (
                  e.org
                )}
              </p>
              {e.detailHtml ? <p class="tl-detail" set:html={e.detailHtml} /> : <p class="tl-detail">{e.detail}</p>}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">selected honors</p>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">A few favorites</h2>
      <div class="spot-grid">
        {honorSpotlight.map((h, i) => (
          <div class="spot reveal" style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 0.07}s`}>
            <span class="spot-year" aria-hidden="true">{h.year}</span>
            <span class="spot-title">{h.title}</span>
            <span class="spot-detail">{h.detail}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="honor-more reveal" id="honor-more">
        <button class="honor-toggle" id="honor-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="honor-trickle">
          <span class="ht-label">the longer list</span>
          <span class="ht-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="honor-clip">
          <ol class="honor-trickle" id="honor-trickle">
            {honorList.map((h, i) => (
              <li class="trickle-item" style={`--i:${i}`}>
                <span class="trickle-title">{h.title}</span>
                <span class="trickle-meta">{h.meta}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-top: clamp(7rem, 16vh, 10rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 2.5rem);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.5vw, 3.4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story-prose {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .story-prose p + p {
    margin-top: 1.2em;
  }

  .story-prose strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 580;
  }

  .story-prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-style: wavy;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 65%, transparent);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .story-prose a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent-strong);
  }

  /* ---- photo album ---- */
  .album {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .polaroid {
    margin: 0;
    width: min(100%, 252px);
    background: #fffdf6;
    border: 1px solid rgba(32, 36, 43, 0.14);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.55rem 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(32, 36, 43, 0.12), 0 14px 30px -18px rgba(32, 36, 43, 0.35);
    transform: rotate(var(--rot, 0deg));
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.35s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .polaroid:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-6px) scale(1.03);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(32, 36, 43, 0.15), 0 26px 50px -20px rgba(32, 36, 43, 0.45);
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .polaroid img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #eee9df;
  }

  .polaroid figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: #6b7280;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.2rem 0.6rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .album {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .polaroid {
      width: min(46%, 240px);
    }

    .polaroid + .polaroid {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

  /* ---- featured ---- */
  .featured-list {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .featured-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .featured-row:hover {
    background: var(--surface-hover);
  }

  .featured-source {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .featured-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .featured-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 560;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .featured-row:hover .featured-title {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .ext {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .featured-note {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .featured-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }
  }

  /* ---- timeline ---- */
  .timeline {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tl-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .tl-row:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .tl-period {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--faint);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tl-badge {
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.12rem 0.55rem;
  }

  .tl-badge.now {
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 45%, transparent);
    background: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .tl-badge.up {
    color: var(--accent-2);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 45%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 10%, transparent);
  }

  .tl-role {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .tl-org {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tl-org a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .tl-org a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-strong);
  }

  .tl-logo {
    height: 15px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .tl-detail {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .tl-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tl-period {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  /* ---- honors: spotlight + flowing list ---- */
  .spot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  .spot {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .spot:hover {
    border-top-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .spot-year {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 14%, transparent);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .spot-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 560;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .spot-detail {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  /* the longer list: expandable, trickles in along a flowing line */
  .honor-more {
    margin-top: 2.6rem;
  }

  .honor-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .honor-toggle:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .ht-label {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-style: wavy;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .ht-plus {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.35rem;
    height: 1.35rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .honor-more.open .ht-plus {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .honor-clip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    transition: grid-template-rows 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .honor-more.open .honor-clip {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
  }

  .honor-trickle {
    overflow: hidden;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.6rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .honor-trickle::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 3px;
    top: 1rem;
    bottom: 0.9rem;
    width: 2px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(var(--accent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 15%, transparent));
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transform-origin: top;
    transition: transform 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) 0.15s;
  }

  .honor-more.open .honor-trickle::before {
    transform: scaleY(1);
  }

  .trickle-item {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.42rem 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-12px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    transition-delay: 0s;
  }

  .honor-more.open .trickle-item {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    transition-delay: calc(0.2s + var(--i) * 0.09s);
  }

  .trickle-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.53rem;
    top: 50%;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    transition-delay: 0s;
  }

  .honor-more.open .trickle-item::before {
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1);
    transition-delay: calc(0.28s + var(--i) * 0.09s);
  }

  .trickle-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 560;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .trickle-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .spot-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .spot-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  /* ---- cta ---- */
  .cta-section {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem) clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem 1.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 1.15rem 1.4rem;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
</style>

<script>
  function initHonors() {
    const wrap = document.getElementById('honor-more');
    const btn = document.getElementById('honor-toggle');
    if (!wrap || !btn) return;
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const open = wrap.classList.toggle('open');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    });
  }

  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initHonors);
</script>
